    "title": "AirSpace API",
    "description": "AirSpace MVP API: vent (text or voice), chat, reflect, and track emotional check-ins.\n\nErrors: business errors are `{\"detail\": \"message\"}`; validation errors (422) return `detail` as a list of `{loc, msg, type}` objects.",
